{title: Where would I be}
{x_theme: grace-mercy, testimony, salvation}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Where would I be.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Where would I be, You only know
I’m glad You see through eyes of love
A hopeless case, an empty place
If not for grace

{comment: Chorus 2}
Amazing grace, how sweet the sound
I once was lost but now I’m found
A hopeless case, an empty place
If not for grace
